              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri suni, bara gogodaana suni ch'ufa, guyyaate dumansa Waaro AABBO Waaqa d'ossee ira tau arge, ammo halkani ibida gubba bobau arga",
          "type": "text",
